  "description": "After Tae-Yoon's ex-boyfriend sends a package to his old address, he quickly rushes to get it before anybody sees it. There, he unexpectedly runs into Jae-Min, a former high school classmate with whom he shares a tense and complicated past. Tae-Yoon flees quickly, hoping it will be their final encounter, but fate insists on intertwining their paths again. To confront his lingering guilt, he offers Jae-Min a sincere apology, only to be met with a shocking suggestion—that they meet five more times. What seems like a simple request leaves Tae-Yoon both confused and anxious, as he begins to wonder what Jae-Min’s true intentions might be. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
